# Production Changes — IIS Windows Authentication Identity Switch

Switching employee identity detection from IP-based to Windows domain login via **IIS Windows Authentication** acting as a reverse proxy in front of the Spring Boot app. IIS handles all domain authentication natively; the app itself just reads the resolved username from a request header. No Kerberos library, no keytab, no SPN registration inside the app.

Nothing else in the app changes — survey form, editing, upsert, HR dashboard all stay exactly as built and tested.

